00:10:04.671 --> 00:10:07.540
Pregnant women, those with skin wounds

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:10.710
A person who is currently menstruating

00:10:10.710 --> 00:10:12.345
Children, please don't pat

00:10:12.345 --> 00:10:14.347
These people are more sensitive

00:10:14.347 --> 00:10:16.149
The pat is wrong

00:10:16.149 --> 00:10:18.017
Something might happen.

00:10:18.017 --> 00:10:19.853
What's a better time to pat?

00:10:19.853 --> 00:10:21.788
There are two suitable time points

00:10:21.788 --> 00:10:23.189
After you get up in the morning

00:10:23.189 --> 00:10:25.258
Or 2 hours before going to bed at night

00:10:25.258 --> 00:10:26.359
Just take a pat

00:10:26.359 --> 00:10:28.461
Only then can the Qi and blood flow freely

00:10:28.461 --> 00:10:30.163
Helps you sleep better

00:10:30.163 --> 00:10:31.898
So, mothers

00:10:31.898 --> 00:10:33.133
you can

00:10:33.132 --> 00:10:35.068
Finished pat in the morning

00:10:35.068 --> 00:10:35.835
Then go

00:10:35.835 --> 00:10:36.903
Buying vegetables at the market

00:10:36.903 --> 00:10:37.770
That's great.

00:10:37.770 --> 00:10:39.706
Pāi bā xū (transliteration) helps you to circulate Qi and blood

00:10:39.706 --> 00:10:41.541
More exercise for better results

